+    <h1>S122: Choose a supported Linux promotion path</h1>
learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--index.html.source:16: trailing whitespace.
+    <p>Assess a fictional candidate, explicitly promote it, and inspect fixed crossing-journey receipts.
learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--index.html.source:17: trailing whitespace.
