learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--linux-promotion.feature.source:1: trailing whitespace.
+Feature: Choose a supported Linux code promotion without claiming native proof
learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--linux-promotion.feature.source:2: trailing whitespace.
+  All hosting, slot, setting, warm-up, routing, promotion and request records
learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--linux-promotion.feature.source:3: trailing whitespace.
+  are fixed fictional teaching data. No Azure operation is available.
learning/S122/evidence/red/browser-red-001--linux-promotion.feature.source:4: trailing whitespace.
+
